&lt;p&gt;Compensation may be adjusted depending on work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1,0&quot;&gt;For San Francisco Bay Area based hires: Estimated annual salary of $164,000 - $226,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
